= Julia Álvarez Resano

Álvarez Resano is a lawyer and one of the first women elected to the Cortes for the <span style="color: #c00000;">**PSOE**</span>. She organizes the party's mutual-aid and welfare work through the Casas del Pueblo, and is one of the few women in a leadership dominated by men.

- @emergency_fundraising
- @welfare
- @organizing_women
