@emergency_fundraising
title: Emergency Fundraising
subtitle: An emergency infusion of resources.
view-if: difficulty < 1
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; emergency_used += 1; resources += 2; industrial_psoe -= 2 if emergency_used > 1; labor_dissent += 5 if emergency_used > 1; unemployed_psoe -= 2 if emergency_used > 1; industrial_psoe -= 2 if emergency_used > 2; unemployed_psoe -= 2 if emergency_used > 2; labor_dissent += 5 if emergency_used > 2; labor_dissent += 5 if emergency_used > 2

[? if emergency_used <= 1: Álvarez Resano has leveraged her networks to pull in donations and arrange quick loans. ?][? if emergency_used > 1 and emergency_used < 3: Discontent is brewing among the <span style="color: #c00000;">**PSOE**</span>'s rank and file over our persistent appeals for money. ?][? if emergency_used > 2: We're really scraping the barrel now—committed members are pressured into selling their valuables, while many others leave in frustration. ?]

We have gained +2 resources.

@welfare
title: Support the Casas del Pueblo mutual-aid networks.
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources > 0 and advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if resources < 0: Not enough resources. ?]
on-arrival: resources -= 1; workers_aid += 1; unemployed_psoe += 5*(1 - dissent); industrial_psoe += 3*(1-dissent); industrial_psoe += 2*(1-dissent) if black_thursday_seen; advisor_action_timer = 6;

We have increased funding to the party's mutual-aid networks. [? if black_thursday_seen > 0 : In an age of economic crisis, this will be helpful for improving our standing among the unemployed. ?]

@organizing_women
title: Organizing women
subtitle: Álvarez Resano's strategies reach more "traditional" women.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: womens_rights += 1; industrial_psoe += 4*(1-dissent); landless_psoe += 3*(1-dissent); smallholder_psoe += 3*(1-dissent); advisor_action_timer = 6

Her strategies for organizing women reach working-class housewives and the wives of braceros, and acknowledge women's traditional household roles. We argue that our welfare programs will improve the livelihoods of women and their families.

[? if psoe_r < 25 : Unfortunately, women still disproportionately support the clerical parties. ?]
